hadiths[47]{hadithnumber,text}:
"680","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ansaar mein se aik aadmi par guzrey jo apne bhai ko haya ke baarey mein naseehat kar raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey chhor do kyonke haya imaan mein se hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"681","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya sirf bhalai lekar aati hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Haya poori ki poori bhalai hai. Ya farmaya: Haya poori bhalai hai."
"682","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imaan sattar se kuchh oopar ya saath se kuchh oopar shaakhein hain, to sab se afzal La ilaha illallah kehna hai aur sab se adna rastey se takleef deh chiz hatana hai, aur haya imaan ki aik shaakh hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"683","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pardey mein kunwari ladki se zyada haya waley they, phir jab Aap koi aisi chiz dekhtey jo Aap napasand farmatey to ham Aap key chehrey mein pehchaan letey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"684","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek martabey mein sab se burey logon mein se wo mard hai jo aurat se milta hai aur aurat us se milti hai phir wo uska raaz pheelata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"685","Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jab unki beti Hafsa bewa ho gaein to farmaya: Main Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se mila aur un par Hafsa pesh ki aur kaha: Agar tum chaho to main tum se Hafsa bint Umar ka nikaah kar dun? Unhon-ne kaha: Main apne muamley mein ghaur karunga. To main chand raatein thehra, phir wo mujh se miley aur unhon-ne kaha: Meri raey hai ke main aaj ke din shaadi na karun. Phir main Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) se mila to unhon-ne mujhey kuchh jawab na diya! To main un par Usman se zyada naraaz tha, phir main chand raatein thehra, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey paighaam diya aur main ne uska nikaah Aap se kar diya. Phir Abu Bakr mujh se miley aur unhon-ne kaha: Shayad tum ne bura manaya jab tum ne mujh par Hafsa pesh ki aur main ne tumhey kuchh jawab na diya? To main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey tumhey uska jawab dene se sirf is ne roka jo tum ne mujh par pesh ki ke main jaanta tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska zikr kya hai, to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz faash karne wala na tha, aur agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey chhor detey to main usey qabool kar leta. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"686","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki azwaaj Aap ke paas thein ke Faatima (Raziallahu anha) chalti hui aaein, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se kuchh bhi khata na karti thein, phir jab Aap ne unhey dekha to unhey khush aamdeed kaha aur farmaya: Meri beti ko khush aamdeed. Phir unhey apne daayein ya baayein bithaya, phir un se sargoshi ki to wo bahut roein, phir jab Aap ne unki be-qaraari dekhi to doosri martaba un se sargoshi ki to wo hansein. To main ne un se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey apni biwiyon mein se sargoshi ke liye khaas kya, phir tum roti ho! Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey to main ne un se poochha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum se kya farmaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz faash karne wali na thi. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey to main ne kaha: Main tumhey qasam deti hun jo mera tum par haq hai ke tum mujhey batao Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum se kya farmaya tha? To unhon-ne kaha: Ab to haan, rahi pehli martaba jab Aap ne mujh se sargoshi ki to mujhey khabar di ke Jibraeel har saal Aap se Quran ka daur aik ya do martaba kartey they, aur unhon-ne ab do martaba daur kya hai, aur main nahi dekhti magar waqt qareeb aa gaya hai, isliye Allah se daro aur sabr karo, kyonke main tumharey liye kitna achchha aagey jaaney wala hun. To main wo roi jo tum ne dekha. Phir jab Aap ne meri be-qaraari dekhi to doosri martaba mujh se sargoshi ki aur farmaya: Ae Faatima! Kya tum raazi nahi ke tum momin aurton ki sardaar ho, ya is ummat ki aurton ki sardaar ho? To main wo hansi jo tum ne dekhi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai."
"687","Saabit se Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas tashreef laey jabke main ladkon ke sath khel raha tha, to Aap ne hamein salaam kya aur mujhey aik kaam ke liye bheja, to main apni walida se dair se aaya. Phir jab main aaya to unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kis ne rok diya? To main ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aik kaam ke liye bheja tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Unka kaam kya tha? Main ne kaha: Wo raaz hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke raaz ki kisi ko khabar na dena. Anas ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar main usey kisi se bayan karta to tumhey bayan karta ae Saabit. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne baaz hissa mukhtasar riwayat kya hai."
"688","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munaafiq ki nishaani teen hain: Jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab waada karey to khilaaf karey, aur jab usey amaanat di jaey to khayaanat karey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Muslim ki aik riwayat mein izafa hai: Chaahey wo roza rakhey aur namaz padhey aur gumaan karey ke wo Musalman hai."
"689","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar hain jo jis mein hon wo khaalis munaafiq hai. Aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke usey chhor dey: Jab usey amaanat di jaey to khayaanat karey, aur jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab ahd karey to dhoka dey, aur jab jhagda karey to gaali dey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"690","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Agar Bahrain ka maal aaya to main tumhey is tarah aur is tarah aur is tarah dunga. To Bahrain ka maal na aaya yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey, phir jab Bahrain ka maal aaya to Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya aur munadi ki: Jis ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par waada ya qarz ho wo hamarey paas aey. To main unke paas aaya aur un se kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se is tarah farmaya tha. To unhon-ne merey liye aik lap bhari, to main ne usey gina to wo paanch sau nikli, phir unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Is jaisi ley lo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"691","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Fulaan ki tarah na hona, wo raat mein qayaam karta tha phir us ne raat ka qayaam chhor diya! (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"692","Adi bin Haatim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh se bacho chaahey khajoor ke tukdey se, phir jo na paey to achchhi baat se. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"693","Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur achchhi baat sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur wo us taweel hadis ka hissa hai jo guzar chuki hai."
"694","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Neki mein se kisi chiz ko haqeer na samjho chaahey apne bhai se khanda peshani se milna ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"695","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab koi baat farmatey to usey teen martaba dohratey yahan tak ke Aap se samajh liya jata, aur jab kisi qaum ke paas aatey aur unhey salaam kartey to unhey teen martaba salaam kartey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"696","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka kalaam wazeh kalaam tha, har sunney wala usey samajhta tha. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"697","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se Hajjatul Wada mein farmaya: Logon ko khamosh karao. Phir farmaya: Merey baad kaafir hokar wapas na laut-na ke baaz baaz ki gardaney maarney lago. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"698","Abu Waa'il Shaqeeq bin Salama se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) hamein har jumeraat yaad dihaani kartey they, to aik aadmi ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Kaash tum hamein har din yaad dihaani kartey. To unhon-ne kaha: Khabardaar! Mujhey is se wahi rokta hai ke main tumhey uktaaney se napasand karta hun, aur beshak main tumhey waaz se taaza rakhta hun, jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein ham par uktaahat key khauf se taaza rakhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"699","Abul Yaqzaan Ammaar bin Yaasir (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aadmi ki namaz ka lamba hona aur uske khutbey ka chhota hona uski samajh ki alaamat hai, isliye namaz lambi karo aur khutba chhota karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"700","Muawiya bin Al-Hakam Sulami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath namaz padh raha tha ke qaum mein se aik aadmi ne chheenkki to main ne kaha: Yarhamukallah. To logon ne mujhey ghoorney lagey! To main ne kaha: Haey meri maa! Tumhey kya hai tum mujhey dekhtey ho? To wo apne haathon se apni raanon par maarney lagey! Phir jab main ne unhey dekha ke wo mujhey khamosh kara rahey hain to main khamosh ho gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, to merey maa baap Aap par qurbaan, main ne Aap se pehley aur Aap key baad Aap se behtar taleem dene wala nahi dekha, Allah ki qasam! Aap ne mujhey na jhidka aur na mujhey maara aur na mujhey bura kaha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye namaz is mein logon ki guftagu mein se kuchh durust nahi, wo to tasbeeh aur takbeer aur Quran ki qiraat hai. Ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main jaahiliyat key qareeb ahd wala hun aur Allah Islam lekar aaya hai, aur beshak ham mein se kuchh aadmi kaahinon ke paas aatey hain? Aap ne farmaya: To unke paas na jao. Main ne kaha: Aur ham mein se kuchh aadmi badfaali letey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo chiz hai jo wo apne seenon mein paatey hain, to wo unhey na rokey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"701","Irbaaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne hamein waaz farmaya jis se dil laraz gaey aur aankhein beh padhein, aur hadis zikr ki, aur ye apne kamaal ke sath Sunnat ki muhaafazat key hukm key baab mein guzar chuki hai, aur ham ne zikr kya ke Tirmizi ne kaha: Beshak wo hasan sahih hadis hai."
"702","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi jama hokar hanstey huey nahi dekha yahan tak ke Aap key halaq ka kinara nazar aey, Aap to muskuratey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"703","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab namaz khadi ki jaey to uskey paas daud-tey huey na aao, balke uskey paas chaltey huey aao jabke tum par sukoon ho, phir jo tum pao wo padho aur jo tum se faut ho jaey wo poori karo. (Muttafaqun aleh). Muslim ne apni aik riwayat mein izafa kya hai: Kyonke tum mein se jab koi namaz ka qasad karta hai to wo namaz mein hai."
"704","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Arafa key din rawana huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne peechey sakht daant dapat aur maar aur oonton ki awaz suni, to Aap ne apne kodey se unki taraf ishara kya aur farmaya: Ae logon! Tum par sukoon laazim hai kyonke neki tez daudney mein nahi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne baaz hissa riwayat kya hai."
"705","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne mehmaan ki izzat karey, aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apna rishta jorey, aur jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo bhalai kahey ya khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"706","Abu Shuraih Khuwailid bin Amr Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai wo apne mehmaan ki uskey inaam key sath izzat karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur uska inaam kya hai ya Rasulullah? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uska din aur raat. Aur mehmaan nawaazi teen din hai, phir jo us se zyada ho wo us par sadqa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Musalman ke liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai key paas itna thehrey ke usey gunah mein daal dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur wo usey gunah mein kaisey daalega? Aap ne farmaya: Uskey paas thehrey jabke uskey paas kuchh na ho jis se wo uski mehmaan nawaazi karey."
"707","Abu Ibrahim, aur kaha gaya Abu Muhammad, aur kaha gaya Abu Muawiya, Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ko Jannat mein moti key ghar ki bashaarat di jis mein na shor hai aur na thakaan. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"708","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apne ghar mein wuzu kya phir nikley aur farmaya: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath rahunga aur aaj key din Aap key sath rahunga. To wo masjid aey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baarey mein poochha to unhon-ne kaha: Idhar tashreef le gaey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To main Aap key peechey nikla aur Aap key baarey mein poochta raha yahan tak ke Aap Beer-e-Arees mein dakhil huey, to main darwazey par baith gaya yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni haajat poori ki aur wuzu kya, phir main Aap ki taraf utha, to Aap Beer-e-Arees par baith chukey they aur uskey darmiyaan mein baith gaey they, aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya hua tha aur unhey kuen mein latkaey huey they. To main ne Aap ko salaam kya phir wapas aaya aur darwazey par baith gaya aur kaha: Aaj main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka darbaan rahunga. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) aey aur darwaza hilaya to main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr. To main ne kaha: Thahro. Phir main gaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye Abu Bakr ijazat maangtey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Usey ijazat do aur usey Jannat ki bashaarat do. To main wapas aaya yahan tak ke main ne Abu Bakr se kaha: Dakhil ho aur Rasulullah tumhey Jannat ki bashaarat detey hain. To Abu Bakr dakhil huey yahan tak ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key daayein taraf Aap key sath mundair mein baith gaey aur apne paaon kuen mein latka diye jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya tha, aur apni pindliyon se kapda uthaya. Phir main wapas aaya aur baith gaya jabke main apne bhai ko chhor aaya tha jo wuzu kar raha tha aur mujh se milney wala tha. To main ne kaha: Agar Allah fulaan key sath, yaani uskey bhai key, bhalai ka irada rakhta hai to usey ley aey. To achanak aik insaan darwaza hila raha hai. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab. To main ne kaha: Thahro. Phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya aur kaha: Ye Umar ijazat maangtey hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Usey ijazat do aur usey Jannat ki bashaarat do. To main Umar key paas aaya aur kaha: Ijazat hai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey Jannat ki bashaarat detey hain. To wo dakhil huey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath mundair mein Aap key baayein taraf baith gaey aur apne paaon kuen mein latka diye. Phir main wapas aaya aur baith gaya aur kaha: Agar Allah fulaan key sath, yaani uskey bhai key, bhalai ka irada rakhta hai to usey ley aey. To aik insaan aaya aur darwaza hilaya. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne kaha: Usman bin Affan. To main ne kaha: Thahro. Aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Usey ijazat do aur usey Jannat ki bashaarat do us aazmaaish key sath jo usey pahunchney wali hai. To main aaya aur us se kaha: Dakhil ho aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey Jannat ki bashaarat detey hain us aazmaaish key sath jo tumhey pahunchney wali hai. To wo dakhil hua aur mundair ko bhara hua paaya to doosri taraf unkey saamney baith gaya. Saeed bin Al-Musayyab ne kaha: To main ne uski taabeer unki qabron se ki. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein izafa hai: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey darwazey ki hifaazat ka hukm diya. Aur us mein hai ke Usman ne jab usey bashaarat di to Allah Taala ki hamd ki, phir kaha: Allah hi madadgaar hai."
"709","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key gird baithey huey they jabke hamarey sath Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) chand logon mein they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey darmiyaan se uth khadey huey aur ham se dair laga di, aur ham ne khauf kya ke Aap ham se kat kar reh jaengey aur ham ghabra gaey aur uth khadey huey. To main sab se pehley ghabraya aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko talaash karne nikla, yahan tak ke main Bani Najjaar key Ansaar key aik baagh tak aaya. To main ne uskey gird phira ke kya mujhey uska darwaza miley, to na mila. To achanak aik naali jo deewaar key andar kuen se bahar se dakhil hoti hai, aur rabee chhoti neher hai, to main simat kar gaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Hurairah? To main ne kaha: Haan ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua? Main ne kaha: Tum hamarey darmiyaan they phir uth khadey huey aur ham se dair laga di, to ham ne khauf kya ke tum ham se kat kar reh jaogey, to ham ghabra gaey aur main sab se pehley ghabraya. To main is baagh tak aaya aur lomdi ki tarah simat kar gaya, aur ye log merey peechey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Aur mujhey apne donon jootey diye aur farmaya: Merey in donon jooton key sath jao, to is deewaar key peechey jis se tum milo jo gawahi deta ho ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jabke uska dil us par yaqeen rakhta ho to usey Jannat ki bashaarat do. Aur lambi hadis zikr ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"710","Ibn Shimaasa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) key paas haazir huey jabke wo haalate marga mein they, to wo bahut dair roey aur apna chehra deewaar ki taraf pher liya. To unka beta kehney laga: Ae merey walid! Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey is is ki bashaarat nahi di thi? Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey is is ki bashaarat nahi di thi? To unhon-ne apna chehra mutawajjah kya aur farmaya: Beshak hamarey paas sab se afzal jo ham shumaar kartey hain wo gawahi hai ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. Beshak main teen tabaqon par tha: Main ne apne aap ko dekha ke mujh se zyada Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bughz rakhney wala koi na tha, aur mujhey is se zyada kuchh mehboob na tha ke main Aap par qaabu paun aur Aap ko qatl kar dun. To agar main us haal par marta to dozakh walon mein se hota. Phir jab Allah ne merey dil mein Islam daal diya to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur kaha: Apna daayaan haath pheelaiye taake main tum se baiyat karun. To Aap ne apna daayaan haath pheelaya to main ne apna haath rok liya. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hai ae Amr? Main ne kaha: Main shart lagana chaahta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Kya shart lagatey ho? Main ne kaha: Ke mujhey bakhsh diya jaey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi jaantey ke Islam usey dha deta hai jo us se pehley tha, aur hijrat usey dha deti hai jo us se pehley thi, aur Hajj usey dha deta hai jo us se pehley tha. Aur mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada mehboob koi na tha aur na meri aankh mein Aap se zyada jaleel koi tha, aur main Aap ki taazeem key sabab Aap ko aankh bhar kar dekhne ki taqat na rakhta tha, aur agar mujh se Aap ka huliya poochha jata to main taqat na rakhta, kyonke main Aap ko aankh bhar kar na dekhta tha. Aur agar main us haal par marta to ummeed rakhta ke Jannat walon mein se hota. Phir ham kuchh cheezon key waali huey, main nahi jaanta mera haal un mein kya hai? Phir jab main mar jaun to merey sath na noha karne wali ho aur na aag, phir jab tum mujhey dafan karo to mujh par matti chhidko, phir meri qabr key gird itni dair thehro jitni mein oont zibah karne aur uska gosht taqseem karne mein lagti hai, taake main tum se maanoos hun aur dekhun ke main apne Rab key bheje huey farishton ko kya jawab deta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"711","To un mein se Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis hai jo Ahle Bait ki izzat key baab mein guzar chuki hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham mein khateeb bankar khadey huey, phir Allah ki hamd ki aur uski sana ki aur waaz aur yaad dihaani ki, phir farmaya: Hamd key baad, khabardaar ae logon! Beshak main bashar hun, qareeb hai ke merey Rab ka qaasid aey aur main qabool karun, aur main tum mein do bhaari cheezein chhorney wala hun: Pehli: Allah ki kitaab, us mein hidayat aur noor hai, isliye Allah ki kitaab ko lo aur usey mazboot pakdo. To Aap ne Allah ki kitaab par ubhara aur us mein raghbat dilai, phir farmaya: Aur merey Ahle Bait, main tumhey Allah yaad dilata hun merey Ahle Bait key baarey mein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur ye apni taveel soorat mein guzar chuki hai."
"712","Abu Sulaiman Maalik bin Al-Huwairis (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke ham hum umr naujawaan they, to ham Aap key paas bees raatein thehrey, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rehem karne waley narm they. To Aap ne gumaan kya ke ham apne ghar walon key mushtaaq ho gaey hain, to Aap ne ham se poochha ke ham apne ghar walon mein se kisey chhor aey hain, to ham ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jao aur un mein thehro, aur unhey sikhao aur unhey hukm do, aur fulaan namaz fulaan waqt mein padho aur fulaan fulaan waqt mein padho. Phir jab namaz ka waqt aey to tum mein se aik tumhey azaan dey aur tum mein sab se bara tumhari imaamat karaye. (Muttafaqun aleh). Bukhari ne apni aik riwayat mein izafa kya hai: Aur namaz padho jaisa tum ne mujhey namaz padhtey dekha."
"713","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Umrah ki ijazat maangi to Aap ne ijazat di aur farmaya: Ae merey bhai! Hamein apni dua mein na bhoolna. To unhon-ne aisi baat kahi jo mujhey us par khush nahi karti ke merey liye uskey badley duniya ho. Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Ae merey bhai! Hamein apni dua mein shareek karna. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"714","Saalim bin Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) us aadmi se kehtey they jab wo safar ka irada karta: Merey qareeb aao taake main tumhey rukhsat karun jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein rukhsat kartey they. To Aap farmatey: Main Allah ko tumhara deen aur tumhari amaanat aur tumharey aamaal key anjaam supurd karta hun. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"715","Abdullah bin Yazeed Khatmi Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab lashkar ko rukhsat karne ka irada farmatey to farmatey: Main Allah ko tumhara deen aur tumhari amaanatein aur tumharey aamaal key anjaam supurd karta hun. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud waghera ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"716","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main safar ka irada rakhta hun to mujhey tosha dein. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhey taqwa ka tosha dey. Us ne kaha: Aur zyada dein. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumhara gunah bakhsh dey. Us ne kaha: Aur zyada dein. Aap ne farmaya: Aur tumharey liye bhalai aasaan farma dey tum jahan bhi ho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"717","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein tamaam muamlaat mein istikhaara sikhaatey they jaisey Quran ki soorat sikhaatey they. Aap farmatey: Jab tum mein se koi kisi kaam ka irada karey to farz key siwa do rakaatein padhey, phir kahey: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se Terey ilm key sath bhalai maangta hun aur Tujh se Teri qudrat key sath taqat maangta hun, aur Tujh se Terey azeem fazl ka sawal karta hun, kyonke Tu taqat rakhta hai aur main taqat nahi rakhta, aur Tu jaanta hai aur main nahi jaanta, aur Tu ghaibon ka jaanne wala hai. Ae Allah! Agar Tu jaanta hai ke ye kaam merey liye merey deen aur meri maeeshat aur merey anjaam mein behtar hai, ya farmaya: Merey haazir aur mustaqbil mein, to usey merey liye muqaddar farma aur merey liye aasaan farma, phir merey liye us mein barkat ata farma. Aur agar Tu jaanta hai ke ye kaam merey liye merey deen aur meri maeeshat aur merey anjaam mein bura hai, ya farmaya: Merey haazir aur mustaqbil mein, to usey mujh se pher dey aur mujhey us se pher dey, aur merey liye bhalai muqaddar farma jahan bhi ho, phir mujhey us par raazi farma. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo apni haajat ka naam ley. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"718","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Eid ka din hota to rasta badal-tey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"719","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Shajara key rastey se nikaltey aur Muarras key rastey se dakhil hotey, aur jab Makkah mein dakhil hotey to oopar ki ghaati se dakhil hotey aur neechey ki ghaati se nikaltey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"720","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne har muamley mein daayaan pasand tha: Apne wuzu mein, aur apne baal sanwaarne mein, aur apna joota pehen-ney mein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"721","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka daayaan haath Aap key wuzu aur khaaney key liye tha, aur baayaan Aap key qazae haajat aur takleef deh cheezon key liye tha. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud waghera ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"722","Umm Atiya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se apni beti Zainab (Raziallahu anha) key ghusl key baarey mein farmaya: Uskey daayein hissey aur uskey wuzu key maqaamon se shuru karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"723","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi joota pehney to daayein se shuru karey, aur jab utaarey to baayein se shuru karey. Daayaan pehney mein pehla aur utarney mein aakhri ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"724","Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna daayaan apne khaaney aur peeney aur kapdon key liye rakhtey they, aur apna baayaan uskey siwa key liye rakhtey they. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi waghera ne riwayat kya hai."
"725","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum pehno aur jab tum wuzu karo to apne daayein se shuru karo. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"726","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina aey: To jamra par aey aur usey kankari maari, phir Mina mein apne thikaaney par aey aur qurbani ki, phir hajjaam se farmaya: Lo. Aur apne daayein taraf ishara kya, phir baayein taraf, phir logon ko deney lagey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jab jamrey ko kankari maari aur apni qurbaani zibah ki aur sar mundwaya: To hajjaam ko apna daayaan hissa diya aur us ne usey moonda, phir Abu Talha Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) ko bulaya aur usey usey diya, phir usey baayaan hissa diya aur farmaya: Moondo. To us ne moonda aur Abu Talha ko diya aur farmaya: Logon mein taqseem karo."
